    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d658">

                <pb facs="0890" n="794" xml:id="pg794"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Day to Mr.
                            Cambon.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-05-31"><hi rendition="#italic">May 31,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 31.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: With reference to the inquiries as
                    to the situation of the master and crew of the captured Spanish steamer <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Panama</hi>, I have the honor to inform you that
                    instructions have been sent to the authorities of the United States at Key West
                    to transmit to the proper authorities of the United States in this capital any
                    open letters addressed by the officers and crew of the steamer in question to
                    their families, to the end that such letters may be forwarded to their
                    destination through your embassy.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">William R. Day.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
